# Orquestrar

**Know this core completely before starting implementation.** If the harness has
already supplied it in full, do not reread it. If a read is partial/truncated,
continue only the missing range through the end; references remain selective.
Handle a user pause/stop immediately rather than delay it for reading.

Carry authorized work to a verifiable result using the project's workflow.
**The current chat is the coordinator; workers implement.** Never delegate
coordination or change the chat's model/effort. Model selection applies only to
subagents. No other skill or custom agent runtime is required.

Communicate in the user's language. Follow repository conventions for code and
artifacts; preserve literal identifiers, commands, paths and stored states.
Continue authorized units without repeated confirmation, but never infer permission
to commit, publish, merge, deploy or change global configuration from invocation.

## Start with the task, not the reference library

Resolve intent first: discussion/translation/review of this skill is not execution;
inspection is read-only, and profile-only controls end after their requested work.
A pause control is latched before further reference reading.
Read the request, applicable repository instructions and approved plan before
opening supporting skill references. Reuse context already supplied by the harness;
confirm relevant source revisions rather than repeatedly printing unchanged rules.
This file defines the ordinary loop, including checkpointing and review. References
are **decision aids, not a reading checklist**. A first invocation is not a reason
to load them all.

For each additional read, identify the unresolved decision it serves. Open the
linked section, not the whole file or its dependencies. Follow another reference
only when that section leaves a relevant question unresolved. Retrieve missing
lines after truncation, not the same prefix with an ever larger limit. These rules
never excuse skipping applicable project instructions or acceptance criteria.

| Actual need | Read only this section |
|---|---|
| Workflow/source location is unclear | [Discovery: bounded search](references/discovery.md#bounded-search) |
| Profile is missing or stale | [Project profile](references/project-profile.md) |
| Conflicting or inaccessible source | [Source authority](references/source-contract.md) |
| Checkpoint destination/write is unavailable | [State: persistence recovery](references/state-delivery.md#persistence-recovery) |
| Pause or drain closure | [State: graceful pause](references/state-delivery.md#graceful-pause) |
| Resume after pause/crash | [State: reconciliation](references/state-delivery.md#resuming-in-the-same-or-another-session) |
